Task 1: Import assert.yml
Description Task 1: Import the assert.yml file for assertions and validations, running only once on localhost.

Task 2: Install required packages
Description Task 2: Install the packages listed in the variable grub_packages.

Task 3: Set GRUB_TIMEOUT
Description Task 3: Set the GRUB_TIMEOUT variable in the /etc/default/grub file with the value of the variable grub_timeout and notify the Update grub handler.

Task 4: Set GRUB_RECORDFAIL_TIMEOUT
Description Task 4: Set the GRUB_RECORDFAIL_TIMEOUT variable in the /etc/default/grub file with the value of the variable grub_recordfail_timeout and notify the Update grub handler.

Task 5: Add options to GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX
Description Task 5: Add options to the GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX variable in the /etc/default/grub file using the list of options in the variable grub_options, notify the Update grub handler, and only perform this task if the grub_options variable is defined and has items.

Task 6: Import password.yml
Description Task 6: Import the password.yml file when the variable grub_set_password is true.

Task 7: Flush handlers
Description Task 7: Ensure all handlers are flushed and run after all tasks have completed.

